        100k:
          $ref: "#/components/schemas/PerformanceV3EndpointWorkload"
        multi_turn:
          $ref: "#/components/schemas/PerformanceV3EndpointWorkload"
      description: "Per-workload figures, as on the website: single requests at three prompt lengths (`1k`, `10k` and `100k` input tokens) and `multi_turn`, the mean of the multi-turn agentic workloads. For an endpoint, each single-request value is the mean of per-run medians over the trailing 5-day window. For a model without a measured performance endpoint, each value is the median across its endpoints. A workload is omitted when it has no measurements in the window."
